OL,3,GNEWSAPark expansion refused over
OL,4,A'excitable' dogs fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog walking site has not been allowed
OL,7,Fto expand over concerns it would lead
OL,8,Fto run-ins between children and
OL,9,F"excitable" dogs.
OL,11,FBradford Council refused a planning
OL,12,Fapplication earlier this year to expand
OL,13,FBingley View Dog Park in East Morton
OL,14,Finto a neighbouring field.
OL,16,FAn amended plan was submitted by K
OL,17,FDrummond but 11 people objected,
OL,18,Fraising concerns about the relationship
OL,19,Fbetween the development and East Morton
OL,20,FRecreation Ground.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
