OL,3,GNEWSAPark expansion refused over
OL,4,A'excitable' dogs fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers ultimately refused the
OL,7,Fproposals, citing concerns that the
OL,8,Fexpanded site would be accessible via
OL,9,FEast Morton Recreation Ground, which
OL,10,Fwould bring "excitable dogs" to an area
OL,11,Fpopular with young children.
